  "prefLabel": "Rev 3101.06 Taxpayer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 3101.06 “Taxpayer” means a New Hampshire resident receiving gambling winnings from any payer or a non-New Hampshire resident receiving gambling winnings from a New Hampshire payer.\n\nSource. #9689-B, eff 4-2-10",
